  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A smaller dray with chestnut colouring, a heavy tan mane, and white feathering, the widely available Holswig Kaltblut is the powerhouse behind much of Reikland's recent prosperity. A common sight down the length of the Reik, the inexpensive Holswig can be found, amongst other things, ploughing fields, hauling timber, and dragging grounded barges from rivers. Although averaging at only 15 hands in height, it is a muscular animal with a broad forehead and heavy shoulders, and is known for its patience.</p>"
